  \end{pmatrix}.$ 在$n_3=-1$处，这个坐标表达式是奇异的，尽管态本身并非如此；本征态就是$\ket d=(0,1)^T$。奇异性属于相位约定，而不属于自旋。

p.src:
Replacing $n$ by $m$ and conjugating gives $\bra{m,+}
  =
  \sqrt{\frac{1+m_3}{2}}
  \begin{pmatrix}
    1&
    \dfrac{1-m_3}{m_+}
  \end{pmatrix}.$ The overlap looks unpleasant, and multiplying it by its conjugate looks worse. Repeated use of Equation [eq:l04-nplus-nminus] reduces the result to $\begin{aligned}
    P(m,+\mid n,+)
    &=\frac{1+n_1m_1+n_2m_2+n_3m_3}{2}\\
    &=\frac{1+\hat n\cdot\hat m}{2}.
  \end{aligned}$ If $\theta_{nm}$ is the angle between the two spatial directions, $P(m,+\mid n,+)
  =
  \frac{1+\cos\theta_{nm}}{2}
  =
  \cos^2\frac{\theta_{nm}}{2}.$

