    P(m,+\mid n,+)
    &=\frac{1+n_1m_1+n_2m_2+n_3m_3}{2}\\
    &=\frac{1+\hat n\cdot\hat m}{2}.
  \end{aligned}$ 若$\theta_{nm}$是两个空间方向之间的夹角，则 $P(m,+\mid n,+)
